{"words": [{"text": "رَبَّنَا", "translation": "Our Lord"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(Do) not"}, {"text": "تُزِغْ", "translation": "deviate"}, {"text": "قُلُوبَنَا", "translation": "our hearts"}, {"text": "بَعْدَ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "[when]"}, {"text": "هَدَيْتَنَا", "translation": "You (have) guided us"}, {"text": "وَهَبْ", "translation": "and grant"}, {"text": "لَنَا", "translation": "(for) us"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "لَّدُنكَ", "translation": "Yourself"}, {"text": "رَحْمَةً ۚ", "translation": "mercy"}, {"text": "إِنَّكَ", "translation": "Indeed You"}, {"text": "أَنتَ", "translation": "You"}, {"text": "ٱلْوَهَّابُ", "translation": "(are) the Bestower"}], "sahih": "[Who say], \"Our Lord, let not our hearts deviate after You have guided us and grant us from Yourself mercy. Indeed, You are the Bestower.1"}